 begin="01:20.110" end="01:23.770">Always gave answer you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.770" end="01:27.690">You really know the reason why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.690" end="01:29.670">Isn I still</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.670" end="01:31.740">And answer you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.740" end="01:34.580">Don't be a cruel to me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.580" end="01:42.580">I on your mind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.270" end="01:46.760">You said I'm thinking too much</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.760" end="01:52.310">But I'm just like that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:52.310" end="01:54.520">Don't get me gone</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.520" end="02:00.040">I just want you to my that</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.040" end="02:02.220">Why should do</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:02.220" end="02:07.900">Something like can escape</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:07.900" end="02:15.700">Broken and can through</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:15.700" end="02:23.700">I don't understand</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:25.710" end="02:30.090">But I can run away from you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:30.090" end="02:34.000">You know how to make me smile</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:34.000" end="02:37.920">You know the way to make me cry</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.920" end="02:42.060">And you know you're the only one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:42.060" end="02:44.350">Who can drive me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:44.350" end="02:46.760">In your life I know</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:46.760" end="02:49.640">Give in to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:49.640" end="02:53.540">You really know the reason why</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:53.540" end="02:55.490">Can listen still</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:55.490" end="02:57.570">Into you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:57.570" end="03:01.570">To me cruel to evenm tired of the lonely am i</p></div></body></tt>